c SATLIB-shaped SAT fixture (#83): same formula as simple_sat.cnf, plus the
c two-line `%` / `0` trailer every uf/uuf archive instance carries. Neither
c line belongs to the formula; reading the `0` as a clause terminator closes
c an empty clause and turns this into a trivially UNSAT instance.
p cnf 3 3
1 2 0
-1 3 0
-2 3 0

%
0
